#issuecomment-3782682968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3819","id":3782682968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7hdylY","user":{"login":"tushar1998","id":22202489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjAyNDg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22202489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998","html_url":"https://github.com/tushar1998","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tushar1998/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-22T06:16:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T06:16:40Z","body":"yes, the main concern is <Field.Control> doing React-state work on each keystroke and causing re-renders in typical usage.\n\nFilled happens once, dirty invokes setDirty on every keystroke","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3782682968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3782934590","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3819#issuecomment-3782934590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3819","id":3782934590,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7hewA-","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm