e_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3819","id":3782934762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7hewDq","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-22T07:25:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T07:25:39Z","body":"> dirty invokes setDirty on every keystroke\n\nReact bails out if it's the same value `onChange`, so it doesn't cause a re-render until the input value returns to the initial value. So for an initially empty input, `filled`/`dirty` change together (batched re-render) and no extra re-renders occur while typing afterwards until the input is cleared again\n\nWith #3820, a re-render occurs once when focusing the control (`focused` state), and then again once on the first keystroke, but not any point after that, for an initially empty input","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3782934762/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui